Thought: To determine the SMILES string of the organic compound sample, I should start by obtaining the mass spectrometry spectra. This will provide information about the molecular weight and possible fragments, which can help in deducing the structure. This is a cost-effective initial step for structure elucidation.
Action: mass_spectrometry_spectra
Action Input: {}

